tlf2a 6 5 7 -1 5 0 0 143
PyApp Grid 1.1 Compact - terminal pixel banner font.
New AI-assisted pixel drawings; not a conversion of Future's glyph data.
6 rows; lossless 2x2 pixel packing into Unicode quadrant cells; one cell right bearing.
Printable ASCII, Latin-1, German capital sharp S, and common symbols.
No kerning/smushing; UTF-8 and a monospaced quadrant-capable terminal required.
